___getX4SqlSearchDA_a: C-12 a,el
SQL:
select *                           
 ,round(An) as Anint               
from da1                           
where (Target like 'C-12')   
  and (Reaction like 'a,el')  
 and (An>=127 and An<=134) and (En<=9e6)
order by fullCode,                 
  YearRef1 desc,DatasetID          
  ,Anint,En,iPoint                 


